<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis Amev details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Fortis Amev details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fortis Amev said on Thursday it had set the stock alternative to its (final) 1996 dividend at one new share for every 69 shares already held.</p>
<p>In March, Fortis Amev announced it would pay a 1996 (final) cash dividend of 1.90 guilders, of which 0.68 guilders had already been paid as an interim dividend. It said at the time that the final payment could be taken up in cash or in new shares.</p>
<p>Fortis Amev shares closed at 80.80 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
